// catalog terms, and "Find in Prune" is the same wording as the menu caption the backend writes into
// the registry (backend/src/services/explorerMenuCaptions.js). The "unsupported", "saveFailed" and
// "loadFailed" sentences are the ones Settings already uses for the sign-in switch. menu.description
